# Test: OSPFv2 guarded opaque LSA inject + observe + withdraw.
#
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-ext-14 -- `debug ip ospf inject opaque ...` originates a Private-Use opaque LSA via the ext-1 seam, it appears in the database, and withdraw MaxAge-flushes it (AC-13/AC-15/AC-23).
# PREVENTS: a regression in the OSPF debug/introspection surface.
#
# Live FRR/QEMU multicast convergence is owned by the ospf-debug-*-frr interop scenarios.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run 'TestDebugInjectOpaqueFloods|TestInjectWithdrawFlushes|TestInjectUsesPrivateOpaqueType' -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=TestDebugInjectOpaqueFloods
expect=stdout:contains=TestInjectWithdrawFlushes
expect=stdout:contains=TestInjectUsesPrivateOpaqueType
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
